==Trivia==
*Attempting to fight the Hell-Rat Behemoth with any pet other than a cat will prompt the message ''"Regrettably, that pet isn't sufficiently interested in killing rats."''
*Unlike the lesser Hell-Rat, the ashes dropped by the Hell-Rat Behemoth do not leave the instance and are not obtainable by the player. 

